    "body": "## Summary\n\nAmends **ADR-034** to include **SVG decode via librsvg**, in addition to the spec'd PNG path. Preserves the original spec's predictions alongside the amendment.\n\n## The measurement that triggered the amendment\n\nAfter #177 merged, diagnostic fetch of the actual wordmark/tagline files:\n\n```\nwordmark.bin   9865 bytes  magic: 3c 73 76 67 (\"<svg xml\")\ntagline.bin   15219 bytes  magic: 3c 73 76 67 (\"<svg xml\")\n```\n\n**Both are SVG, not PNG.** The spec's first caveat was correct to flag the contingency — the actual case was SVG.\n\nThe SVGs are trivial:\n- Only `<defs>`, `<g>`, `<path>`, `<svg>` — exactly **3 `<path>` elements each**\n- Geometric logo curves, no `<text>`, no embedded raster, no gradients\n\nAnd `librsvg-2.0` is available system-wide (version 2.58.0, `librsvg2-dev:amd64` installed).\n\n## What the amendment extends\n\n**`<img>` paint** (extend from PNG-only):\n- Decode PNG via Cairo (`cairo_image_surface_create_from_png_stream`)\n- Decode SVG via librsvg (`rsvg_handle_new_from_data` + `rsvg_handle_render_document`)\n- Format dispatch on magic bytes (`89 50 4e 47` = PNG, `3c 73 76 67` / `3c 3f 78` = SVG)\n\n**`background-image` paint** (new — not in original spec):\n- Extract `url(...)` from ComputedStyle at layout time → `LayoutBox::background_image_url`\n- Paint fetch + decode (same PNG/SVG dispatch) at box rect\n- Handles `data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg...>` inline data URLs (search icon)\n\n**`position: absolute` completion**: unchanged from spec.\n\n## Updated visible delta prediction\n\n**Spec-only (pre-amendment)**: zero visible delta. PNG-only scope, zero PNGs in first viewport.\n\n**Post-amendment**: three visible deltas in first viewport:\n\n1. **Wikipedia wordmark** (~248x36, header, x=52 y=14)\n2. **Wikipedia tagline** (~248x?, below wordmark)\n3. **Search icon** (magnifying glass ~18x18, search input left)\n\nFirst PNG diff from ADR-030 baseline: **first `<img>` in HoneyBee's history, first SVG decode, first non-text paint output**.\n\n## Honest caveats (unchanged)\n\n1. **Images don't reserve layout space** — wordmark is inside a fixed-height header (36px from ADR-030), so overlap is bounded and tolerable. Article-body images still overlap until ADR-035.\n2. **JPEG, `background-repeat`, `background-size calc()`, `background-position`** deferred.\n3. **`<text>` inside SVG** would need font resolution — not needed for wordmark/tagline but a future limitation.\n\n## CMake change\n\n```cmake\npkg_check_modules(RSVG REQUIRED librsvg-2.0)\n```\n\nPlus `${RSVG_LIBRARIES}` linked into honeybee_lib.\n\n## What this preserves\n\nThe arc's pattern: **original predictions stay in place, amendment is added alongside**. A future reader sees the spec's PNG-only scope, the amendment's SVG extension, and the measurement that drove it. No rewriting.\n\nSame discipline as ADR-028/029/030/031/032/033's corrections — just applied to the spec-level prediction rather than a post-implementation result.\n\nRefs #177\n",
